DreamUIWidgetBinding:SubObjectPathRelativeToWidget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamUIWidgetBinding.h#DreamUIWidgetBinding:SubObjectPathRelativeToWidget
    src   "Optional: a sub-object of the widget (a behaviour, visual, or layout), as its path name\nrelative to the widget. Empty binds the widget itself. This is how an exported animation\nkeeps its component and visual bindings."
    text  "可选：控件的一个子对象（行为、视觉或布局），以其相对于控件的\n路径名表示。为空则绑定控件本身。导出的动画\n正是通过这种方式保留其组件和视觉绑定。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetBinding:WidgetPath {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamUIWidgetBinding.h#DreamUIWidgetBinding:WidgetPath
    src   "'/'-joined display names from the loaded root down; empty binds the root widget itself."
    text  "从已加载根节点向下、以“/”连接的显示名称；为空则绑定根控件本身。"
    state machine
